I noticed that at our site. In some cases the data size limit for batch jobs
run under nqs wasn't being enforced. What it looked like was that the data
size limit wasn't being checked at initial load but only if extra memory
was allocated using brk. Our fix was to use address space limits instead
of just data space limits.



