From: Eric Bennett <bennett@hpel.umd.edu>
Subject: Security concerns over local wu-ftpd setup.
Date: 1995/11/17
Message-ID: <Pine.OSF.3.91.951117083212.21688A-100000@chessie2.hpel.umd.edu>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 119574201
