Then You have been lucky - under normal circumstances this will not work.
That's because swapping of a 4 byte value (int) and of a 2 byte value (short)
is different. If You have binary files with mixed data, let's say
doubles, floats, ints, shorts and strings, then every item has to be swapped
appropriately!

