I don't know where to get dos2unix and unix2dos for Alpha but if my experience with them
on Ultrix is anything to go by you are much better to use zip and unzip to accomplish
the conversion.

e.g. dos2unix 

      zip -ll file.zip file
      unzip file.zip

     unix2dos

       zip -l file.zip file
       unzip file.zip

They ran way way faster than dos2unix and unix2dos did on Ultrix so I switched and have never
gone back

Dick




