I ran the lastest Ingres 6.4/05/02 (the first one produced by CA) on
DU 3.2 back in April-June.  It seemedto work OK until I tried to restore
an online checkpoint... It failed with a lot of messages about locked
mutex on buffer pages...  I went back to version 6.4/05/00, the last
version delivered to us by Ask back in the DEC OSF/1 version 1.3 days
and it worked ok.

BTW, it works but it is not certified (as least it was not certified 
on 3.2 at that time)...  so as usual you are on your own if you hit
a problem, i.e. you have to reproduce the problem on a certified DU
version before you can get any support.

Hope this helps!!!




